  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**CVC 입력을 비우지 못하는 경로가 있습니다.**\n\n현재 조건식 때문에 `''`(삭제 상태)가 차단되어 사용자가 CVC를 지우기 어렵습니다. 또한 blur 핸들러의 `preventCvc(cvc)` 호출은 반환값을 사용하지 않아 의미가 없습니다.\n\n<details>\n<summary>수정 방향 예시</summary>\n\n```diff\n-const preventCvc = (cvc: string) => {\n-  if (!isNumericString(cvc)) return false;\n-  if (cvc.length > 3) return false;\n-  return true;\n-};\n+const preventCvc = (value: string) => {\n+  if (value === '') return false;\n+  if (!isNumericString(value)) return true;\n+  if (value.length > 3) return true;\n+  return false;\n+};\n\n const handleChangeCvc = (value: string) => {\n-  if (!preventCvc(value)) return;\n+  if (preventCvc(value)) return;\n   setCvc(value);\n };\n\n const handleBlurCvc = () => {\n-  preventCvc(cvc);\n   setOnBlurCvc(true);\n };\n```\n</details>\n\n\n\n\nAlso applies to: 125-127\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@src/pages/payments/Payments.tsx` around lines 108 - 123, preventCvc currently\nblocks the empty string and thus prevents users from clearing the CVC; also a\ncall to preventCvc in the blur handler is unused. Update preventCvc to\nexplicitly allow '' and otherwise enforce isNumericString(value) and\nvalue.length <= 3; keep handleChangeCvc using preventCvc to gate setCvc. Remove\nthe meaningless call to preventCvc from any onBlur handler (or use its boolean\nresult if the blur logic needs it) so onBlurCvc/renderErrorMessageCvc and\nvalidateCvc can handle empty-value validation/display correctly.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:grasshopper:67e66621-4774-4e43-87e7-c8b23edd26d7 -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
